WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.885
Mazatl and his father had traded all their corn.

2
00:00:14.886 --> 00:00:19.287
In return, they received goods their family needed.

3
00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:21.763
The market was closing.

4
00:00:21.764 --> 00:00:25.881
Most sellers were quickly wrapping up their blankets.

5
00:00:25.882 --> 00:00:32.339
“What’s going on?” Mandy asked. “Mazatl, where’s Vinnie?”

6
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:37.269
“The priests will make an offering to our gods,” replied Mazatl.

7
00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.404
“Follow me to the temple.

8
00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:43.379
I’m sure Vinnie will be there.”

9
00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:47.919
Vinnie heard the drums beating faster and faster.

10
00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.946
He turned and saw a parade leaving the ball court.

11
00:00:51.947 --> 00:00:54.159
The game was over.

12
00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:58.478
Men in animal costumes danced around.

13
00:00:58.479 --> 00:01:01.005
Some pretended to fight.

14
00:01:01.006 --> 00:01:04.473
Other people sang and chanted loudly.

15
00:01:04.474 --> 00:01:07.098
People were playing flutes too.

16
00:01:07.099 --> 00:01:10.618
Vinnie thought it was a victory celebration.

17
00:01:10.619 --> 00:01:14.037
“Who won?” he asked a young boy.

18
00:01:14.038 --> 00:01:17.103
“Who cares?” replied the boy.

19
00:01:17.104 --> 00:01:19.535
“All the players are prisoners.

20
00:01:19.536 --> 00:01:21.808
Today the losers will die.

21
00:01:21.809 --> 00:01:26.154
But all the prisoners will be given to the gods someday soon.”

22
00:01:26.155 --> 00:01:31.284
The crowd was now heading toward the pyramid.

23
00:01:31.285 --> 00:01:37.692
“What? The losing team is going to die?” gasped Vinnie.

24
00:01:37.693 --> 00:01:41.874
“Their blood will be given to the gods,” said the young boy.

25
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:46.700
“In return, the gods will give us good weather for our crops.”

26
00:01:46.701 --> 00:01:49.274
Vinnie could not believe it!

27
00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:52.207
He watched the players who had lost.

28
00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:57.497
Tied together, the group was being pushed forward by the temple guards.

29
00:01:57.498 --> 00:02:01.466
Vinnie didn’t want to see what was about to happen.

30
00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:05.339
But the crowd shoved him up front.

31
00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:10.415
“Mandy! Mazatl!” he shouted as loud as he could.

32
00:02:10.416 --> 00:02:14.275
But the drums continued to beat louder.

33
00:02:14.276 --> 00:02:16.549
No one could hear him.

34
00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.269
Mandy followed Mazatl to the temple.

35
00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:26.281
“It’s amazing!” she remarked when she saw the tall pyramid.

36
00:02:26.282 --> 00:02:30.267
She asked Mazatl about the two buildings on the top.

37
00:02:30.268 --> 00:02:34.419
“Those are where the sacrifices are held,” he explained.

38
00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:40.072
“Why are these people being killed?” she asked carefully.

39
00:02:40.073 --> 00:02:44.666
“Today is a festival to honor our gods,” said Mazatl.

40
00:02:44.667 --> 00:02:46.666
Mandy understood.

41
00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:51.035
To Mazatl, the gods controlled the lives of his family.

42
00:02:51.036 --> 00:02:54.203
Sacrifice was important to the gods.

43
00:02:54.204 --> 00:03:01.006
So people had to die for the future well-being of the Aztecs.

44
00:03:01.007 --> 00:03:04.278
“Mazatl, do you see Vinnie?

45
00:03:04.279 --> 00:03:08.681
Oh, where is he?” she cried.

46
00:03:08.682 --> 00:03:10.271
“I don’t see him.

47
00:03:10.272 --> 00:03:15.009
He must be trapped in the crowd somewhere,” replied Mazatl.

48
00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.615
Mandy yelled for Vinnie.

49
00:03:17.616 --> 00:03:22.210
Worried, she ran as fast as she could toward the temple.

50
00:03:22.211 --> 00:03:27.872
Meanwhile, Vinnie managed to break away from the crowd.

51
00:03:27.873 --> 00:03:30.550
“Whew! I can breathe!”

52
00:03:30.551 --> 00:03:33.405
he said, wiping his forehead.

53
00:03:33.406 --> 00:03:37.938
A single line of men moved slowly in front of him.

54
00:03:37.939 --> 00:03:40.614
Vinnie felt someone push him hard.

55
00:03:40.615 --> 00:03:45.001
“Hey!” Vinnie turned angrily.

56
00:03:45.002 --> 00:03:48.017
The person pushing him held a spear—

57
00:03:48.018 --> 00:03:50.673
it was a temple guard!

58
00:03:50.674 --> 00:03:54.219
Only then did Vinnie realize where he was.

59
00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:57.274
He was in the line to be sacrificed.

60
00:03:57.275 --> 00:03:59.468
He tried to explain.

61
00:03:59.469 --> 00:04:01.814
“There’s been a mistake!”

62
00:04:01.815 --> 00:04:08.342
But the guard only pushed him forward again.
